 "said": [
  "2 ways to measure notes_files, in order: a Tracked files in the repository (already recorded) (existing_series); b Count of tracked notes files under notes/ (script)",
  "the Dynamics page shows them in the element's drawer, \"How to measure it\"",
  "notes_files linked to repo_files (option a, the existing series), so its expected effects can be judged; caveat: Counts every tracked file, not only notes files: it moves when any file is added. The notes count is 24 of its 32 today.. Tell the owner it is linked, with the caveat; if they do not want it, they say so and you unlink it (link declared=notes_files unlink=true, quoting them), and only then add another option"
 ],
 "kept_in": "Orchestra's declared layer: the Dynamics and Machines pages draw it",
 "options": [
  {
   "key": "a",
   "title": "Tracked files in the repository (already recorded)",
   "kind": "existing_series",
   "clearance": "cleared: reads only this machine, the project's own metrics store and its repository"
  },
  {
   "key": "b",
   "title": "Count of tracked notes files under notes/",
   "kind": "script",
   "clearance": "cleared: reads only this machine, the project's own metrics store and its repository"
  }
 ]
}

